{"2317180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cube Crusaders", "steam_appid": 2317180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adoros is dying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophic Void Anomaly threatens to tear open Adoros' surface, warping reality and unleashing forces no one fully understands. You are a Cube Crusader, sent to deal with this threat for the continued success of the Crusades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/79e559596a9b8dc1748d1e8ea20ce9c6.poster.avif?t=1788208636\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/79e559596a9b8dc1748d1e8ea20ce9c6.webm?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/79e559596a9b8dc1748d1e8ea20ce9c6.mp4?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CAMPAIGN</strong>    <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take on Adoros' various metroidvania style underground as you seek to crush the Void Anomaly and the horrors it produces alone, or with a local couch co-op buddy. Fight Bosses, mobs, and face the challenges of the Adoros Underground. You can further challenge yourself with Curse Modifiers to make the game more challenging, and heavily alter the experience for added replayability.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/cb5cd947990d5cecf1fd65221ac8d66d.poster.avif?t=1788208636\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/cb5cd947990d5cecf1fd65221ac8d66d.webm?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/cb5cd947990d5cecf1fd65221ac8d66d.mp4?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CRUSADER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Enjoy a full customization system with unlockable rewards and show off your sense of style across all gamemodes. Customize all elements of your Crusader, including particle effects. Unlocks are earned through gameplay exclusively, and there are no microtransactions! <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/309a1efeba128b81f9f5b1104369b895.poster.avif?t=1788208636\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/309a1efeba128b81f9f5b1104369b895.webm?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/309a1efeba128b81f9f5b1104369b895.mp4?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PVE HORDE MODE - LOCAL OR ONLINE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something underground has inflicted great suffering on the Cube Crusaders on the surface of Adoros, and turned them into Cube-Eating zombies! Fight for survival as the horde becomes more numerous and powerful with each new wave, with up to 16 players online (2 locally) against this endless onslaught... After earning enough Credits through gameplay in Horde Mode and Campaign, unlock Nightmare Mode, enabling the Horde to truly become a swarm-pile of ruthless enemies. <br><br>**While we've tested up to 16 players, host settings allow for lobby sizes of up to 200 players, though this setting is untested I found no reason to cap the player count at just 16.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/d66dd2f6155ea5aff1dbb2adf31ea738.poster.avif?t=1788208636\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/d66dd2f6155ea5aff1dbb2adf31ea738.webm?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317180/extras/d66dd2f6155ea5aff1dbb2adf31ea738.mp4?t=1788208636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube Crusaders will be continually updated and improved for a 6 month duration after launch integrating community suggestions and bug fixes. Come join our Discord to voice your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Adoros is dying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophic Void Anomaly threatens to tear open Adoros' surface, warping reality and unleashing forces no one fully understands. You are a Cube Crusader, sent to deal with this threat for the continued success of the Crusades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/